--- !u!114 &652636841
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 652636839}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a49f9ef0c3f023e4d8526b389e8729de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EndingCutsceneManager
  storyText: {fileID: 344152785}
  continuePrompt: {fileID: 31814430}
  segments:
  - As you approach the shrine, the runes glow with warm light. The stone statue
    seems to breathe.
  - "The fragments of her soul swirl around you, memories cascading through your
    mind. You see her final moment\u2014standing defiant against the encroaching
    darkness."
  - She didn't hesitate. Didn't flinch. She gave everything so that life could continue.
    So that you could stand here today.
  - The light of the fourteen runes merge, drawn to the statue like moths to flame.
    Cracks of golden light spread across the stone.
  - "The stone crumbles. She opens her eyes\u2014no longer carved marble, but living,
    breathing warmth. She smiles, a single tear rolling down her cheek.\""
  - '''You remembered,'' she whispers. ''After all this time... someone remembered.'''
  - The darkness that once threatened this realm has long passed. But she remained,
    trapped between stone and spirit, waiting for one soul brave enough to piece
    her back together.
  - '''Thank you,'' she says, her form beginning to shimmer with ethereal light.
    ''I can finally rest. The realm is safe. You made sure of that.'''
  - As she fades into light, the world around you blooms. Flowers sprout where stone
    once lay. The air fills with warmth. Life returns in full.
  - She's gone, but not forgotten. Never forgotten. Her legacy lives on in you, in
    this restored realm, in every life she saved. You were the keeper of her memory.
    And that made all the difference.
  typeSpeed: 0.03
  segmentDelay: 1
  musicForThisCutscene: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c126ec652b84e3d4ca0a2bf6c51f3b86, type: 3}
  stopMusicOnFinish: 1
  nextSceneIndex: 0
